    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You can construct a short-range Jammer that affects <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a>. As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>, you make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check to build the Jammer. When a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> comes within 6 squares of you, compare the result of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check to the Droid's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>. If your check result equals or exceeds the Droid's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>, the Droid can only take <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Actions\" title=\"Swift Actions\">Swift Actions</a> as long as it remains within the radius of the Jammer.<br><br>Droids that are immune to the effect of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Restraining_Bolt\" title=\"Restraining Bolt\">Restraining Bolt</a> are immune to the effects of this Talent. The Jammer functions for the remainder of the encounter. You may only have one Jammer (Device or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a>) active at a time.",
